WEBVTT

01:53.000 --> 01:53.840
Miss.

01:56.920 --> 01:57.650
Take it away.

02:06.480 --> 02:07.510
What's going on?

02:09.150 --> 02:09.949
You may leave.

02:10.000 --> 02:10.520
Yes.

02:35.470 --> 02:36.600
On such a joyous day,

02:37.840 --> 02:39.120
how could you be upset?

03:00.240 --> 03:01.360
It's such a pity

03:02.840 --> 03:05.440
that Father, Mother,
and Yiren can't see this.

03:05.470 --> 03:06.470
But

03:07.750 --> 03:08.910
it doesn't matter.

03:10.150 --> 03:11.520
After the ceremony,

03:13.280 --> 03:15.810
we can visit their graves
to pay our respects.

03:17.240 --> 03:18.000
Right?

03:19.560 --> 03:20.760
And while we're at it,

03:21.520 --> 03:23.520
we can also give Qiushui a surprise.

03:29.280 --> 03:30.310
I said long ago

03:32.000 --> 03:33.260
that my husband must be

03:34.240 --> 03:36.700
a hero who commands awe
in the martial world.

03:40.120 --> 03:43.980
This is the Hero Command Token
that commands awe in the martial world.

03:44.910 --> 03:46.470
I'm giving it to you today.

03:46.910 --> 03:50.960
From now on, we can rule
the martial world together.

04:11.120 --> 04:11.800
Kaiyan,

04:13.910 --> 04:15.190
I was once an orphan,

04:15.680 --> 04:17.940
fortunate to be raised by the Xiao family

04:18.269 --> 04:20.000
and have even learned medicine

04:20.000 --> 04:21.070
to help others.

04:22.870 --> 04:23.870
I aspired

04:24.600 --> 04:26.000
to help as many as I could,

04:26.870 --> 04:28.480
not to marry a man

04:28.720 --> 04:29.800
and spend my life

04:30.430 --> 04:31.490
raising children.

04:37.270 --> 04:40.510
But all that's behind me now.

04:42.360 --> 04:43.800
I've thought it through.

04:45.120 --> 04:47.750
One must look forward

04:50.630 --> 04:52.870
and get over those useless obsessions.

05:15.830 --> 05:16.720
Cheers.

05:29.720 --> 05:31.650
I'm glad you've changed your mind.

05:32.600 --> 05:35.070
In the future, whether you want
to practice medicine

05:35.070 --> 05:36.670
or travel the martial world,

05:36.800 --> 05:39.870
Daxi isn't the only place
where you can shine.

06:07.000 --> 06:08.070
You poisoned me.

06:11.800 --> 06:14.360
One must look forward.

06:18.120 --> 06:18.720
Yes.

06:19.630 --> 06:21.290
I only want to do one thing now,

06:23.920 --> 06:25.240
and that's to kill you.

06:33.830 --> 06:36.040
Why has all my family turned against me?

06:55.680 --> 06:56.740
If that's the case,

06:57.430 --> 07:00.360
it seems only your death
will make you stay.

07:01.270 --> 07:03.630
I'll make you all see

07:04.070 --> 07:07.510
who is the true glory of the Xiao family!

08:01.310 --> 08:02.920
Took you long enough.

08:04.360 --> 08:05.510
You finally showed.

08:06.630 --> 08:07.240
Come on.

08:07.870 --> 08:08.390
Sit.

08:08.870 --> 08:09.630
Have a seat.

08:13.360 --> 08:14.120
Xiao Kaiyan.

08:16.870 --> 08:17.730
Where is Xueyu?

08:22.600 --> 08:23.510
Don't rush.

08:25.070 --> 08:28.510
Today is Xueyu's and my wedding day.

08:30.120 --> 08:32.450
It's been a while since we drank together.

08:32.669 --> 08:33.270
Come on.

08:34.909 --> 08:35.909
Let's…

08:37.720 --> 08:39.200
have a drink.

08:45.670 --> 08:46.360
What?

08:48.030 --> 08:49.690
You're afraid it's poisoned?

08:51.720 --> 08:52.600
Don't worry.

08:53.480 --> 08:54.960
I won't kill you yet.

09:01.720 --> 09:02.720
All this time…

09:05.600 --> 09:07.600
we couldn't find Xueyu.

09:09.150 --> 09:11.080
Turns out you locked her up here

09:12.870 --> 09:14.400
and forced her to marry you.

09:17.510 --> 09:18.790
I'm not drinking this.

09:22.440 --> 09:23.640
You don't deserve it.

10:10.720 --> 10:12.120
Look at you.

10:16.120 --> 10:17.600
You've become such a mess.

10:21.270 --> 10:22.480
Did you forget?

10:25.080 --> 10:26.340
Since you were little,

10:28.270 --> 10:30.930
Xueyu has been the one
who cared for you the most.

10:37.840 --> 10:39.270
Did I…

10:39.750 --> 10:41.080
did I mishear?

10:43.910 --> 10:45.910
She cared for me the most?

10:48.750 --> 10:49.840
You mean

10:51.080 --> 10:52.740
you guys cared for me the most?

10:53.600 --> 10:54.660
If that's the case,

10:56.030 --> 10:58.670
let's get things straight.

11:00.360 --> 11:02.200
All my life…

11:04.480 --> 11:06.720
all my life…

11:10.630 --> 11:14.560
you've been put on a pedestal
like a main character since you were born!

11:14.910 --> 11:16.600
Someone disposable like me

11:17.270 --> 11:18.910
would never amount to much!

11:20.720 --> 11:21.780
So Mother taught me

11:22.480 --> 11:23.390
to keep my head down

11:23.390 --> 11:25.720
and live a quiet life.

11:28.910 --> 11:30.750
You and Yiren were much valued!

11:32.670 --> 11:34.240
But what was Xiao Yiren like?

11:34.240 --> 11:35.270
Stubborn and self-willed—

11:35.270 --> 11:37.130
nothing like a young sect leader!

11:37.270 --> 11:38.510
And you, a troublemaker,

11:38.510 --> 11:40.720
how are you better than me in any way?

11:42.910 --> 11:44.910
Let me tell you, today,

11:46.080 --> 11:47.600
the martial world

11:48.440 --> 11:49.320
and even the whole country

11:49.320 --> 11:50.390
belong to me!

11:50.440 --> 11:51.360
Whatever I want,

11:51.360 --> 11:53.270
I will get it!

12:29.440 --> 12:30.080
Xueyu.

12:34.440 --> 12:35.150
Xueyu.

12:42.510 --> 12:44.720
Why can't even my wedding day

12:46.270 --> 12:49.720
go the way I want?

12:59.030 --> 12:59.870
Xueyu.

13:05.270 --> 13:06.240
Xueyu.

13:08.750 --> 13:09.910
It's me, Qiushui.

13:12.440 --> 13:14.080
Don't scare me, Xueyu.

14:17.510 --> 14:18.960
Xiao Xueyu.

14:21.600 --> 14:23.800
My great ambition is not yet fulfilled.

14:26.270 --> 14:27.870
How could you have died?

14:45.440 --> 14:46.720
Xiao Qiushui,

14:49.000 --> 14:51.670
you want me dead now, don't you?

14:53.600 --> 14:55.480
On our wedding day,

14:56.440 --> 14:59.270
all she could think about was killing me.

15:00.720 --> 15:01.870
Why do I have to try so hard

15:01.870 --> 15:03.720
and give up everything, every single time,

15:03.720 --> 15:06.120
just to get what I want?

15:19.080 --> 15:19.720
Xueyu.

15:22.630 --> 15:24.080
Let me take you home.

15:39.840 --> 15:42.080
I only wanted to give her a chance,

15:42.600 --> 15:45.030
but she still chose to betray me.

15:45.720 --> 15:47.240
I'll destroy everything

15:47.240 --> 15:48.910
you care about!

15:51.030 --> 15:52.390
Your sister is dead.

15:53.000 --> 15:55.000
What are you still holding back for?

15:56.080 --> 15:56.910
Kill me.

15:58.200 --> 15:59.480
Kill me now!

16:01.910 --> 16:03.150
Kill me,

16:05.000 --> 16:07.320
and you'll never find General Wu.

16:10.270 --> 16:11.150
Xiao Qiushui,

16:12.720 --> 16:13.650
you're a coward.

16:15.870 --> 16:17.270
He's a coward.

16:41.910 --> 16:43.360
I won't kill you.

16:44.000 --> 16:45.030
If I did,

16:46.270 --> 16:49.030
who'd watch me rule the world?

16:49.720 --> 16:53.000
Keeping you alive is far more fun

16:54.080 --> 16:56.200
than killing you.

16:58.270 --> 16:59.510
You're pathetic.

17:20.680 --> 17:22.550
When it comes to lightness skills,

17:22.550 --> 17:26.000
you three are top-tier.

17:29.440 --> 17:30.960
I hear that too often.

17:31.400 --> 17:33.440
But since you said it,

17:33.720 --> 17:35.310
I won't be modest.

17:38.070 --> 17:39.200
But unfortunately,

17:39.640 --> 17:40.920
compared with those
in the Daxi martial world

17:40.920 --> 17:43.920
where there are all kinds of masters,

17:45.000 --> 17:47.070
your inner energy and sword skills

17:47.350 --> 17:48.750
still come up short.

17:49.720 --> 17:51.070
All kinds of masters?

17:51.920 --> 17:54.270
If you ask me, it's all kinds of scum.

17:55.070 --> 17:57.310
If not for the traitors within Daxi,

17:57.790 --> 18:00.240
how could Xiao Kaiyan
have captured Wu Jie?

18:02.720 --> 18:05.480
General Wu is indeed here.

18:08.110 --> 18:09.510
It's fine to tell him.

18:09.830 --> 18:11.920
Wu Jie's failure to report to the capital

18:11.920 --> 18:14.440
has already caused suspicion
and discontent at court.

18:14.440 --> 18:16.270
Even if we release him now,

18:16.440 --> 18:19.510
it won't stop
the Northern Wastelanders' grand plan.

18:24.510 --> 18:25.550
You three

18:26.440 --> 18:28.270
claim to be esteemed elders
of the martial world,

18:28.270 --> 18:29.920
but in my eyes,

18:30.070 --> 18:32.270
you're just chasing wealth and status.

18:32.400 --> 18:36.070
Why else would you
take orders from Xiao Kaiyan?

18:39.880 --> 18:41.310
Very well, Crazy Yan,

18:41.510 --> 18:44.400
people say you're unparalleled
in the Daxi martial world.

18:44.400 --> 18:45.200
Then, today,

18:45.830 --> 18:48.720
we'd like to learn
a thing or two from you.

18:49.000 --> 18:49.930
To learn from me?

18:51.680 --> 18:52.590
How?

19:16.310 --> 19:17.680
With just the likes of you,

19:17.680 --> 19:19.680
you think you can shake Daxi's rule?

19:20.310 --> 19:22.830
Today, I, Crazy Yan, will show you

19:23.270 --> 19:25.400
the real martial arts of Daxi.

19:35.030 --> 19:35.830
Mr. Yan,

19:36.920 --> 19:38.650
it seems I underestimated you.

19:38.920 --> 19:40.510
I originally planned to spare your life

19:40.510 --> 19:41.510
for Xueyu's sake,

19:41.510 --> 19:43.310
but now there's no need for that.

19:43.640 --> 19:44.920
Where is General Wu?

19:44.920 --> 19:46.920
General Wu doesn't matter anymore.

19:47.110 --> 19:47.960
Mr. Yan,

19:48.440 --> 19:49.680
I'll gladly claim

19:50.440 --> 19:51.970
all of your martial skills.

20:21.510 --> 20:25.370
So this is the internal energy
of the greatest master of martial arts?

20:26.550 --> 20:27.240
Great!

20:28.680 --> 20:29.750
Mr. Yan.

20:31.590 --> 20:33.310
Thank you for your gift!

20:33.510 --> 20:36.070
You're nothing but a thieving rat,

20:37.070 --> 20:39.790
trying to throw Daxi into chaos.

20:40.510 --> 20:41.680
You won't succeed.

21:29.680 --> 21:30.400
Tell me,

21:31.310 --> 21:33.510
what's the purpose of living?

21:34.510 --> 21:35.440
To live with joy,

21:36.400 --> 21:37.530
die without regret,

21:38.030 --> 21:39.960
and do what's right.

21:40.510 --> 21:41.910
Live life to the fullest!

21:42.750 --> 21:44.150
Live life to the fullest!

21:46.920 --> 21:48.320
Live life to the fullest.

21:50.510 --> 21:51.200
Qiushui,

21:52.920 --> 21:53.920
the rest

21:55.750 --> 21:56.680
is up to you.

23:02.070 --> 23:03.920
Mr. Yan told Xueyu

23:05.000 --> 23:06.530
about the Voidheart Codex.

23:06.830 --> 23:10.510
Xueyu risked her life to write it down
on her sleeve

23:11.510 --> 23:12.710
just so I could see it.

23:13.270 --> 23:13.960
Yiren,

23:14.920 --> 23:15.590
Xueyu,

23:17.030 --> 23:20.440
please watch over Father
and Mother for me down there.

23:21.240 --> 23:22.680
After I avenge you,

23:24.110 --> 23:25.240
I'll come join you.

24:52.680 --> 24:54.350
No!

25:13.680 --> 25:16.030
Nobody in this world can

25:16.750 --> 25:18.310
or has the right

25:19.110 --> 25:21.310
to make you do what you are reluctant to.

25:22.200 --> 25:23.800
That's what all your family,

25:23.830 --> 25:25.160
who truly love you,

25:25.680 --> 25:27.590
would wish for you.

25:44.640 --> 25:45.110
Father.

25:45.750 --> 25:46.400
I'm tired.

25:47.070 --> 25:48.510
This qin piece is too difficult.

25:48.510 --> 25:49.710
I just can't learn it.

25:50.070 --> 25:51.330
Swordplay is hard too.

25:51.680 --> 25:53.540
But I've never heard you complain

25:53.680 --> 25:55.310
when you practice.

25:55.550 --> 25:56.680
That's not the same.

25:57.310 --> 25:59.440
Swordsmanship is in the Xiaos' blood.

26:00.000 --> 26:02.310
No matter how much I practice,
I never get tired.

26:02.310 --> 26:03.920
Kaiyan, you try it.

26:04.720 --> 26:05.350
Father,

26:06.000 --> 26:07.440
what's even written here?

26:07.440 --> 26:09.030
I can't understand any of it.

26:09.030 --> 26:09.920
Look at you.

26:10.160 --> 26:12.310
Your sword practice is sloppy,

26:12.680 --> 26:15.480
and when it comes to the qin,
you don't know a thing.

26:33.000 --> 26:34.640
Very good! Very good!

26:35.070 --> 26:38.070
Fortunately, the Xiao family has Qiushui.

26:39.510 --> 26:41.510
He's got talent, taking after me.

26:42.310 --> 26:46.030
This piece is
called "Snow Across the Land."

26:46.960 --> 26:48.310
Profound and ethereal.

26:48.880 --> 26:50.030
It speaks to me.

26:50.510 --> 26:51.200
Qiushui,

26:52.070 --> 26:53.000
practice hard.

27:09.680 --> 27:10.540
Unexpectedly,

27:10.880 --> 27:12.880
to repay the debt, the Jiang brothers

27:12.880 --> 27:14.240
not only carved the Voidheart Codex

27:14.240 --> 27:15.920
into the walls of the Sword Manor

27:15.920 --> 27:18.380
but also hid it
within the notes of qin music.

27:18.550 --> 27:20.550
The Voidheart Codex values inner state.

27:20.550 --> 27:22.080
Moves arise with the music,

27:22.310 --> 27:24.310
and infinity unfolds with the mind.

27:33.310 --> 27:34.640
But my father told me

27:35.400 --> 27:37.830
that people who want
to make the world better

27:37.830 --> 27:40.880
will always find each other.

27:45.310 --> 27:46.640
That's why

27:48.510 --> 27:52.110
it's righteousness that binds us together
in the martial world.

27:53.000 --> 27:53.930
To live with joy,

27:54.680 --> 27:55.810
die without regret,

27:56.240 --> 27:58.240
and do what's right.

27:58.680 --> 28:00.080
Live life to the fullest!

28:43.920 --> 28:45.510
I must avenge the dead.

28:46.310 --> 28:48.510
They were all once real, living people!

28:57.070 --> 28:58.240
The Voidheart Codex

28:58.830 --> 29:00.230
contains 15 techniques.

29:01.160 --> 29:01.680
Namely,

29:02.920 --> 29:03.780
Heaven's Will,

29:04.640 --> 29:05.500
Earth's Power,

29:06.640 --> 29:07.310
Sovereign,

29:08.350 --> 29:09.240
Kin's Thought,

29:10.680 --> 29:11.810
Master's Teaching,

29:12.310 --> 29:13.110
Cutting Gold,

29:14.110 --> 29:14.880
Firm Wood,

29:15.960 --> 29:16.820
Flowing Water,

29:18.270 --> 29:19.070
Burning Fire,

29:20.590 --> 29:21.390
Buried Earth,

29:22.960 --> 29:23.690
Shining Sun,

29:24.680 --> 29:25.680
Moon Reflection,

29:27.200 --> 29:28.060
Drifting Wind,

29:29.110 --> 29:30.040
Veiling Clouds,

29:31.720 --> 29:32.550
and No Self.

29:56.440 --> 29:57.240
Turns out

29:59.070 --> 30:00.070
to not care…

30:12.400 --> 30:13.680
is to care for all.

30:46.680 --> 30:47.480
Your Majesty.

30:55.640 --> 30:56.310
Leave us.

31:10.920 --> 31:12.310
Chenzhou, come.

31:12.480 --> 31:13.920
No need for formalities. Come here

31:13.920 --> 31:15.520
and have a few drinks with me.

31:21.680 --> 31:22.960
Chenzhou, please.

31:29.310 --> 31:30.510
The Immortal Pass...

31:30.720 --> 31:32.680
It's rare for us brothers to meet again.

31:32.680 --> 31:34.200
Today, let's not talk about state affairs

31:34.200 --> 31:35.200
and just enjoy the wine.

31:35.200 --> 31:35.830
Chenzhou,

31:36.640 --> 31:38.510
join me for this drink.

31:52.830 --> 31:53.640
Chenzhou,

31:54.720 --> 31:58.120
do you know this fine wine
comes from the Northern Wasteland?

31:58.830 --> 32:01.720
If we could use this chance
to stop the war and negotiate for peace,

32:01.720 --> 32:03.510
I believe delicacies
and fine wines like this

32:03.510 --> 32:04.830
will keep flowing in.

32:05.270 --> 32:06.110
To stop the war

32:07.000 --> 32:08.400
and negotiate for peace?

32:08.790 --> 32:10.520
Your Majesty, you may not know.

32:11.160 --> 32:14.820
The Northern Wastelanders
are about to breach the Immortal Pass.

32:15.400 --> 32:16.680
Once they do,

32:17.350 --> 32:19.110
Daxi will be left wide open

32:19.440 --> 32:20.700
with no defenses left.

32:20.960 --> 32:22.440
Even the capital could be lost.

32:22.440 --> 32:23.240
Your Majesty,

32:23.880 --> 32:25.340
whose fault would that be?

32:26.920 --> 32:29.680
Chenzhou, why did you say that?

32:30.240 --> 32:32.470
Aren't we in peace negotiations right now?

32:32.470 --> 32:34.030
Why worry about the pass falling?

32:34.030 --> 32:35.270
Could it be that someone is

32:35.270 --> 32:37.550
trying to use the chaos
between Daxi and the Northern Wasteland

32:37.550 --> 32:39.350
to slip in and scheme for power?

32:43.640 --> 32:44.640
All these years,

32:45.310 --> 32:48.160
I've been aware that people keep saying

32:48.680 --> 32:50.510
I indulge in pleasure

32:51.350 --> 32:53.680
and have no will
to reclaim the Central Plains.

32:53.680 --> 32:54.510
But do you know

32:54.550 --> 32:56.310
that Daxi has been weak for so long,

32:56.310 --> 32:58.710
and the more we fight,
the weaker we become?

32:58.880 --> 33:00.680
The people don't understand me.

33:00.920 --> 33:03.520
But do you
not understand me either, Chenzhou?

33:04.640 --> 33:06.000
Everything I've done

33:06.270 --> 33:08.330
is for the well-being of Daxi people!

33:09.350 --> 33:11.210
For the well-being of the people?

33:11.920 --> 33:13.350
Has Your Majesty truly considered

33:13.350 --> 33:14.410
the people of Daxi?

33:15.000 --> 33:16.660
If peace talks were possible,

33:16.680 --> 33:18.790
how could things have come to this?

33:19.310 --> 33:20.570
If war broke out again,

33:21.000 --> 33:22.680
who'd benefit from it?

33:25.030 --> 33:26.310
And that Wu Jie—

33:27.030 --> 33:28.680
he still hasn't returned to the capital,

33:28.680 --> 33:31.540
and his Wu Army on the front lines
won't heed orders.

33:31.750 --> 33:32.590
Is someone

33:33.680 --> 33:35.010
working with the Wu Army

33:35.680 --> 33:37.240
in secret,

33:37.920 --> 33:40.050
giving them the nerve to be so defiant?

33:41.270 --> 33:42.720
Countless soldiers died

33:42.920 --> 33:44.160
on the battlefield.

33:45.110 --> 33:46.680
The general was betrayed by villains,

33:46.680 --> 33:47.750
his fate unknown.

33:48.240 --> 33:49.240
Yet Your Majesty,

33:50.000 --> 33:51.730
instead of fighting the enemy,

33:52.030 --> 33:54.350
you're suspicious of me, a mere idle man.

33:54.920 --> 33:55.980
If this continues,

33:56.310 --> 33:57.030
how can Daxi

33:57.680 --> 33:58.720
not fall?

33:58.720 --> 34:00.180
Li Chenzhou, how dare you!

34:00.240 --> 34:02.310
How dare you speak such treasonous words!

34:02.310 --> 34:04.070
Emperor Taizu established the nation
on horseback.

34:04.070 --> 34:05.790
Emperor Taizong ruled
with both civil wisdom and military might.

34:05.790 --> 34:07.650
For ages, all nations bowed to us.

34:07.790 --> 34:09.989
Clinging to old ways leads to a dead end.

34:10.000 --> 34:12.260
How can compromise bring lasting peace?

34:13.230 --> 34:15.480
Daxi has 100 years of legacy.

34:16.320 --> 34:18.710
It all hangs on the court's will now.

34:24.440 --> 34:26.590
You've truly spoiled my mood.

34:27.320 --> 34:29.320
I had hoped to share more drinks with you,

34:29.320 --> 34:31.320
but now I see you have no interest.

34:32.429 --> 34:34.030
I'm busy with state affairs.

34:35.030 --> 34:36.030
See yourself out.

34:40.110 --> 34:40.800
I've had

34:42.320 --> 34:43.550
enough of this wine.

34:50.110 --> 34:51.000
Here is

34:51.510 --> 34:53.370
to the soldiers on the front lines

34:55.110 --> 34:58.170
and to all the fallen men and women
of the martial world.

35:28.440 --> 35:29.630
Think carefully.

35:30.230 --> 35:33.290
The Northern Wastelanders pretend
to negotiate peace

35:33.630 --> 35:36.160
while secretly planning
to invade the south.

35:37.960 --> 35:41.590
Your Majesty,
do you remember your ambition

35:42.510 --> 35:44.840
to march north and reclaim our lost lands?

35:48.110 --> 35:49.960
I will fulfill it in my own way.

35:50.880 --> 35:52.140
Take care of yourself.

36:00.150 --> 36:01.110
Li Chenzhou,

36:01.880 --> 36:03.610
don't blame me for being cruel.

36:04.320 --> 36:07.960
You chose the path to death yourself.

39:20.150 --> 39:21.030
Chenzhou!

40:00.880 --> 40:01.710
Shirong.

40:07.920 --> 40:09.030
Why are you here?

40:11.840 --> 40:13.360
I've come to take you home.

40:34.480 --> 40:35.510
Chenzhou!

40:47.880 --> 40:48.920
Chenzhou.

40:51.070 --> 40:52.070
Chenzhou.

40:54.880 --> 40:56.190
Wake up.
